 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Countries",
     "texto": [
      "Gender belongs to each noun, and it does not always follow the pattern you would expect. Many country names ending in **-ия** or **-а** are feminine: **Япония**, **Мексика**, **Аргентина**, **Германия**. **Китай** is masculine.",
      "To say where you are from, use **из + genitive**: **Китай → из Китая**, **Мексика → из Мексики**, **Германия → из Германии**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Naming and speaking languages",
     "texto": [
      "The adjective agrees with **язык** (masculine): **китайский язык**, **японский язык**, **английский язык**. To say «in Russian/English», the adverbial forms with a hyphen are used: **по-русски**, **по-английски**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
